{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:01:12Z","thinking":"**Designing the Structure**\n\nOkay, I'm diving into the `index.html` structure now, aiming for that BillionAir Idle Tycoon look and feel alongside the Parent-Co-Play structure. I'm focusing on a top banner for the parent prompt, `.parent-prompt-signboard`, with a font size of at least 23px. After that, I'm working on the top navigation for the 8 levels.\n\n\n**Defining Level Components**\n\nI've moved on to defining the components for each level, starting with a wardrobe in Level 1. I'm assigning `data-fit` and `data-type` attributes to clothing items, and am planning the `Bin Avatar` card. I've also detailed Level 2's suitcase with allowed items, specifying items to send to the parents. Level 3 includes a security station with a pass card, X-ray screen, and gate detector, and level 4 consists of boarding gates with character ticket cards.\n\n\n**Detailing Level Structures**\n\nI'm now detailing level structures, specifically Level 5, an airplane seat with a plush box, safety sign, and Bin's knight cape, along with a metal buckle and drink button. Level 6 features a cloud window with morphing clouds and Level 7 has emotional buttons and a foot-tucking interaction. Finally, Level 8 is defined with an unbuckle latch, carousel with a red bear suitcase, and a \"EXCELLENT YOUNG PASSENGER\" badge modal.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"vi\\\">\\n<head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\\\">\\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Airport BillionAir Style)</title>\\n    <!-- Google Fonts Nunito với fallback hệ thống mượt mà -->\\n    <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n    <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n    <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"css/style.css\\\">\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n    <div id=\\\"app-root\\\">\\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\\n        <canvas id=\\\"effects-canvas\\\"></canvas>\\n\\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\\n        <header class=\\\"top-nav\\\">\\n            <nav class=\\\"stage-indicators\\\" aria-label=\\\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\\\">\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot active\\\" data-screen=\\\"1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\\\">👕</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"2\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 2: Xếp vali\\\">🧳</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"3\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\\\">🎫</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"4\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\\\">🚪</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"5\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\\\">🦸</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"6\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\\\">☁️</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"7\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 7: Lịch sự\\\">🤫</button>\\n                <button class=\\\"stage-dot\\\" data-screen=\\\"8\\\" aria-label=\\\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\\\">🏆</button>\\n            </nav>\\n\\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\\n            <\n<truncated 28343 bytes>","Description":"\"Cập nhật index.html master theo phong cách Airport BillionAir và Parent-Co-Play\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\index.html\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update index.html\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
